DESCRIPTION:In this session\, we will show you how to get started using AI
  as a tool to create your own programs with no previous programming knowl
 edge! We will discuss different resources and how to make decisions to pe
 rsonalize the vibe coding experience to your goals. We'll also take a loo
 k at what to be aware of when creating code written by AI as well as best
  practices.
