DESCRIPTION:Discover how AI-powered coding tools can streamline your acade
 mic workflow\, no programming experience required. In this hands-on sessi
 on\, we'll walk through a series of live demos showing how faculty can us
 e conversational AI to tackle everyday tasks: transforming course materia
 ls into interactive experiences\, analyzing student data to find insights
 \, building lightweight tools tailored to your teaching needs\, and more.
  Whether you've never written a line of code or you're a seasoned program
 mer\, you'll leave with practical ideas for putting AI to work in your co
 urses and research.
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20260416T183905Z
