DESCRIPTION:A hands-on workshop exploring how the inputs you provide to an
  LLM-system prompts\, examples\, retrieved data\, and conversation histor
 y-shape its outputs far more than the model itself. Participants will lea
 rn practical techniques for structuring\, compressing\, and curating cont
 ext to get reliable results. Through live exercises\, we'll iterate on re
 al prompts and see how small context changes produce dramatically differe
 nt outcomes.
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20260416T184250Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260527T120000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260416T184250Z
