CREATED:20260416T173008Z
DESCRIPTION:In this presentation\, we'll explore how AI-powered chat and a
 utomation capabilities are delivered across the Microsoft 365 ecosystem. 
 We'll look at the full spectrum of Microsoft AI tools-from the built-in c
 hat experiences in Microsoft 365 Copilot to more advanced\, customizable 
 solutions built with Copilot Studio.\n\nUsing the M365 suite\, we'll walk
  through how an AI agent can be created\, grounded in organizational file
 s and knowledge sources\, and extended with tools such as email\, databas
 es\, and Power Automate. Along the way\, we'll discuss when lightweight\,
  out-of-the-box chat features are sufficient and when it makes sense to m
 ove toward richer\, more tailored experiences using Copilot Studio.\n\nLe
 arners will need an active Co-Pilot license to fully participate\, howeve
 r all are welcome to join and listen.
DURATION:PT1H30M
DTSTAMP:20260416T184422Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260527T143000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260416T184422Z
LOCATION;X-BEDEWORK-UID=00f1fcdb-0f068baf-010f-068baf6e-00000000:None
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Developing AI Solutions with Microsoft Co-Pilot Studio and Microso
 ft 365
