DESCRIPTION:This practical workshop will address the challenges facing edu
 cators who find their traditional assessments are less effective measures
  of student learning in the age of generative AI. We will discuss how to 
 develop AI-resistant assessments\, as well equip educators with ideas of 
 how to create effective AI-integrated assignments. Participants will disc
 over how AI can enhance learning experiences\, foster critical thinking\,
  help with individualized learning\, and promote collaboration among stud
 ents.
DURATION:PT1H30M
DTSTAMP:20260416T184621Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260527T143000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260416T184621Z
