 a dynamic symposium exploring the future of neural engineering and neurot
 echnology\, and engage with cutting-edge ideas\, interdisciplinary collab
 oration\, and real-world applications shaping the field.\nThe symposium w
 ill feature keynote speaker Joey O'Doherty\, Head of Next Gen Application
 s at Neuralink Corp and PhD in Biomedical Engineering from Duke Universit
 y.\nThe symposium is free to attend and lunch will be provided.\nScan the
  QR code or go to duke.is/attend to register by Wednesday\, May 20\, 2026
 .
